{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-08-18 06:00:00', 'title': 'IBM AND USTA ANNOUNCE MULTI-YEAR PARTNERSHIP RENEWAL AHEAD OF 2022 US OPEN', 'text': 'REDESIGNED USOPEN.ORG AND US OPEN APP WILL INCLUDE NEW FAN EXPERIENCES LEVERAGING HYBRID CLOUD AND EXPLAINABLE AI\xa0 ARMONK, N.Y. , AUG. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IBM (NYSE: IBM ) AND THE UNITED STATES TENNIS ASSOCIATION (USTA) TODAY ANNOUNCED A FIVE-YEAR RENEWAL OF THEIR LONGSTANDING, 30-YEAR PARTNERSHIP.'}